  "glossary": {
    "emo": "Emo (karakter adı)",
    "proog": "Proog (karakter adı)",
    "snarlers": "hırlayan şeyler; filmde hayalî makine adı",
    "pulp": "posa; burada ezilmiş bir kütle",
    "ground": "ezilmiş, öğütülmüş",
    "sick": "hasta; burada rahatsız, dengesiz",
    "babylon": "Babil",
    "colossus": "dev heykel",
    "rhodes": "Rodos",
    "clockwork": "saat mekanizması; kusursuz işleyiş",
    "hah": "hah! (ünlem)",
    "b": "but kelimesinde kekeleme (ama)",
    "n": "no kelimesinde kekeleme (hayır)"
  },
  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 15,
      "end": 18.13,
      "text": "At the left we can see…"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.13,
      "end": 20.5,
      "text": "At the right we can see the—"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.5,
      "end": 21.98,
      "text": "…the head-snarlers."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.98,
      "end": 24.55,
      "text": "Everything is safe… Perfectly safe."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.55,
      "end": 25.77,
      "text": "Emo?"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.12,
      "end": 27.22,
      "text": "Emo?"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.62,
      "end": 30.104,
      "text": "Watch out!"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.56,
      "end": 48.26,
      "text": "Are you hurt?"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.99,
      "end": 54.2,
      "text": "I don’t think so. You?"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.52,
      "end": 57.09,
      "text": "I’m OK."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.09,
      "end": 61.11,
      "text": "Get up, Emo! It’s not safe here."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.03,
      "end": 63.22,
      "text": "Let’s go."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.22,
      "end": 65.19,
      "text": "What’s next?"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.19,
      "end": 66.96,
      "text": "You’ll see!"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.68,
      "end": 68.84,
      "text": "You’ll see!"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.03,
      "end": 78.48,
      "text": "Emo! This way."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.22999999999999,
      "end": 95.47999999999999,
      "text": "Follow me!"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.1,
      "end": 132.52100000000002,
      "text": "Hurry, Emo!"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.438,
      "end": 170.063,
      "text": "You’re not paying attention!"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.063,
      "end": 174.31,
      "text": "I–I just want to answer the phone."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.31,
      "end": 177.04,
      "text": "Emo, look… I mean, listen."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.14,
      "end": 182,
      "text": "You have to learn to listen."
    },
    {
      "start": 183.14,
      "end": 185.04,
      "text": "This is not some game."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.04,
      "end": 189.18,
      "text": "You… I mean, we. We could easily die out here."
    },
    {
      "start": 190.01,
      "end": 194.39600000000002,
      "text": "Listen… Listen to the sounds of the machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 198.05,
      "end": 200,
      "text": "Listen to your breathing."
    },
    {
      "start": 266.646,
      "end": 269.313,
      "text": "Well, don’t you ever get tired of this?"
    },
    {
      "start": 269.313,
      "end": 271.09,
      "text": "Tired?!"
    },
    {
      "start": 271.09,
      "end": 273.31,
      "text": "Emo, the machine is like…"
    },
    {
      "start": 273.31,
      "end": 275.26,
      "text": "Like clockwork!"
    },
    {
      "start": 275.26,
      "end": 277.063,
      "text": "One move out of place…"
    },
    {
      "start": 277.063,
      "end": 279.12,
      "text": "…and you’re ground to a pulp."
    },
    {
      "start": 280.95,
      "end": 282.104,
      "text": "But isn’t it—"
    },
    {
      "start": 282.104,
      "end": 286.03,
      "text": "Pulp, Emo! Is that what you want? Pulp?"
    },
    {
      "start": 287.104,
      "end": 290.42,
      "text": "Emo, your goal in life…"
    },
    {
      "start": 290.44,
      "end": 291.95,
      "text": "…pulp?!"
    },
    {
      "start": 341.31,
      "end": 343.42,
      "text": "Emo, close your eyes."
    },
    {
      "start": 344.15,
      "end": 345.396,
      "text": "–Why?\n–Now!"
    },
    {
      "start": 351.15,
      "end": 351.97,
      "text": "OK."
    },
    {
      "start": 353.11,
      "end": 354.68,
      "text": "Good."
    },
    {
      "start": 359.42,
      "end": 362.1,
      "text": "What do you see at your left side, Emo?"
    },
    {
      "start": 364.02,
      "end": 366,
      "text": "–Nothing.\n–Really?"
    },
    {
      "start": 366,
      "end": 367.58,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "start": 367.58,
      "end": 371.98,
      "text": "Really? A–And at your right? What do you see at your right side, Emo?"
    },
    {
      "start": 373.31,
      "end": 376.84,
      "text": "The same, Proog. Exactly the same…"
    },
    {
      "start": 376.84,
      "end": 379.896,
      "text": "–…nothing!\n–Great."
    },
    {
      "start": 399.97,
      "end": 402.72,
      "text": "Listen, Proog! Do you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 403.44,
      "end": 404.56,
      "text": "Can we go here?"
    },
    {
      "start": 405.063,
      "end": 406.56,
      "text": "–There?\n–Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "start": 406.58,
      "end": 408.188,
      "text": "It isn’t safe, Emo."
    },
    {
      "start": 409.14,
      "end": 412.01,
      "text": "–B–But…\n–Trust me, it’s not."
    },
    {
      "start": 413.02,
      "end": 414.17,
      "text": "Well, maybe I could…"
    },
    {
      "start": 414.17,
      "end": 415.146,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "start": 417.1,
      "end": 418.82,
      "text": "–But…\n–No!"
    },
    {
      "start": 418.82,
      "end": 420.24,
      "text": "No!"
    },
    {
      "start": 420.771,
      "end": 423.05,
      "text": "Any further questions, Emo?"
    },
    {
      "start": 423.97,
      "end": 425.09,
      "text": "N–No."
    },
    {
      "start": 429.05,
      "end": 430.08,
      "text": "Emo?"
    },
    {
      "start": 431.14,
      "end": 433.08,
      "text": "Emo, why?!"
    },
    {
      "start": 433.08,
      "end": 435.36,
      "text": "Emo, why…?"
    },
    {
      "start": 435.36,
      "end": 438.84,
      "text": "Why can’t you see the beauty of this place?"
    },
    {
      "start": 438.84,
      "end": 440.646,
      "text": "The way it works."
    },
    {
      "start": 440.646,
      "end": 443.92,
      "text": "How… How perfect it is."
    },
    {
      "start": 443.92,
      "end": 447.04,
      "text": "No, Proog, I don’t see."
    },
    {
      "start": 447.04,
      "end": 449.97,
      "text": "I don’t see because there’s nothing there."
    },
    {
      "start": 451.05,
      "end": 455.24,
      "text": "And why should I trust my life to something that isn’t there?"
    },
    {
      "start": 455.24,
      "end": 456.6,
      "text": "Well, can you tell me that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 456.6,
      "end": 457.38,
      "text": "Emo…"
    },
    {
      "start": 457.38,
      "end": 458.92,
      "text": "Answer me!"
    },
    {
      "start": 462.97,
      "end": 464,
      "text": "Proog…"
    },
    {
      "start": 465.05,
      "end": 466.854,
      "text": "…you’re a sick man!"
    },
    {
      "start": 466.854,
      "end": 468.90999999999997,
      "text": "Stay away from me!"
    },
    {
      "start": 472.188,
      "end": 474.854,
      "text": "No! Emo! It’s a trap!"
    },
    {
      "start": 475.42,
      "end": 476.979,
      "text": "Hah, “it’s a trap!”"
    },
    {
      "start": 476.979,
      "end": 481.229,
      "text": "At the left side you can see the Hanging Gardens of Babylon!"
    },
    {
      "start": 481.96,
      "end": 483.95,
      "text": "How’s that for a trap?"
    },
    {
      "start": 485.72,
      "end": 486.92,
      "text": "No, Emo."
    },
    {
      "start": 489,
      "end": 492.64,
      "text": "At the right side you can see—well guess what…"
    },
    {
      "start": 492.64,
      "end": 494.66,
      "text": "…the Colossus of Rhodes!"
    },
    {
      "start": 495.32,
      "end": 496.39,
      "text": "No!"
    },
    {
      "start": 496.396,
      "end": 500.16,
      "text": "The Colossus of Rhodes! And it is here just for you, Proog."
    },
    {
      "start": 500.16,
      "end": 501.688,
      "text": "Just for you!"
    },
    {
      "start": 531,
      "end": 533.021,
      "text": "It is there…"
    },
    {
      "start": 533.021,
      "end": 536.04,
      "text": "I’m telling you, Emo…"
    },
    {
      "start": 537,
      "end": 539.86,
      "text": "…it is… there…"
    }
  ]
}
